repository-code: "https://github.com/Ron-Builds-AI/pass-sum-closed-form"
abstract: >-
  A pass sum from Kim and Thorne (1991), written in a closed form through a Mellin-Barnes representation, with written proofs of the
  pieces an earlier draft left open, and the integer values where the logarithmic terms vanish: a chain given by the Pell-type equation
  y^2 - 3b^2 = -2. Checked by exact arithmetic and high-precision numerics; not yet read by a mathematician.
keywords:
  - "Mellin-Barnes integral"
  - "asymptotic expansion"
  - "Pell equation"
  - "closed form"
